Z||000006||Bob Englert||04-23-2001||04:55 PM||||Tim:<P>As was said earlier, our next meeting will be in the Raleigh area the weekend before Memorial Day Weekend (5/19).  Will probably try to have the next one either in Charlotte or out toward Hickory again, too early to tell right now.<P>Are you getting my e-mail messages regarding the meetings?  I would be happy to add you to the list if you want.<P>I was considering inviting NC MR2 owners to the next meeting.  In spite of some of the flames recently, the 2 cars share some common design concepts and I would enjoy seeing some up close and learning about some of the differences.  <P>Anyone think there would be interest in Fiero and MR2 owners hanging out together for a few hours???<P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl<p>[This message has been edited by Bob Englert (edited 04-23-2001).]||||reg||1
